From a0d7b9615f1bfdc71fa4d87d149ad33a7c4d1a56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:15:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Require reported CI when PRs have no required checks

Collect complete exact-head evidence before considering an absence waiver. Apply all-check fallback, preserve merge cutoff and required contexts, and refuse empty suites and malformed pages. Keep CLOSED and landing dispositions unchanged.

Proof: initial regressions 12 failed/1 passed before fix; canonical consumer suites 589 passed, 1 skipped. Five fallback mutants killed; restored fallback suite green. Read-only replay rejects historical mods PR101/102 without rerunning CI. Local preliminary review caught empty-suite CI; added fail-closed coverage. Independent published-head review and required CI remain landing gates.
